OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric damaged gates to be
OL,4,Areplaced in the autumn
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to repair a historic riverside
OL,7,Fgarden's gates which were severely
OL,8,Fdamaged after a car crashed through
OL,9,Fthem could start in the autumn.
OL,11,FThe oak replica gates at Caversham
OL,12,FCourt Gardens, which lie next to the
OL,13,FRiver Thames in Reading, were broken in
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FThe site is Grade II listed and was
OL,17,Fbought by the Reading Corporation in
OL,18,F1931, which demolished its original
OL,19,Fhouse and opened its gardens as a
OL,20,Fpublic park in 1934.
